{"id": "8th-booster-q1175", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "direct", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-booster-bridging", "lesson_id": "8th-booster-thirukkural", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "thirukkural-porutpal-iyal-count", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "திருக்குறளின் பொருட்பாலில் அமைந்துள்ள இயல்களின் எண்ணிக்கை எத்தனை?"}], "options": {"A": "இரண்டு இயல்கள்", "B": "நான்கு இயல்கள்", "C": "மூன்று இயல்கள் (அரசியல், அமைச்சியல், ஒழிபியல்)", "D": "ஐந்து இயல்கள்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 66 & TNPSC பாடக்குறிப்பு: திருக்குறள் பொருட்பாலில் 3 இயல்கள் (அரசியல் 25, அமைச்சியல் 32, ஒழிபியல் 13) அமைந்துள்ளன. அறத்துப்பாலில் 4 இயல்களும், காமத்துப்பாலில் 2 இயல்களும் உள்ளன."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "How many sections (Iyals) are present in Porutpal of Thirukkural?"}], "options": {"A": "Two sections", "B": "Four sections", "C": "Three sections (Arasiyal, Amaichiyal, Ozhibiyal)", "D": "Five sections"}, "explanation": "Textbook Page 66 & TNPSC syllabus: Porutpal is divided into 3 sections: Arasiyal (25 chapters), Amaichiyal (32 chapters), and Ozhibiyal (13 chapters)."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Cor