{"id": "8th-booster-q1201", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "odd_one_out", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u5-vanigam", "lesson_id": "8th-booster-grammar", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "thogaithodar-odd-one-out", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தொகை வகையின் அடிப்படையில் பொருந்தாத ஒன்றைத் தேர்க:"}], "options": {"A": "பாய்புலி (வினைத்தொகை; ஏனையவை பண்புத்தொகைகள்)", "B": "செங்காந்தள் (பண்புத்தொகை)", "C": "வட்டத்தொட்டி (பண்புத்தொகை)", "D": "இன்மொழி (பண்புத்தொகை)"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 110-112: செங்காந்தள், வட்டத்தொட்டி, இன்மொழி ஆகிய மூன்றும் பண்புத்தொகைகள். பாய்புலி என்பது பாய்ந்த புலி, பாய்கின்ற புலி, பாயும் புலி என முக்காலமும் காட்டும் 'வினைத்தொகை' ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Identify the odd compound based on compound classification:"}], "options": {"A": "Paaipuli (Vinaithogai; the others are Panbuthogai)", "B": "Sengaanthal (Panbuthogai)", "C": "Vattathotti (Panbuthogai)", "D": "Inmozhi (Panbuthogai)"}, "explanation": "Textbook Pages 110-112: Sengaanthal, Vattathotti, and Inmozhi are Panbuthogai compounds. Paaipuli is a Vinaithogai spanning all three tenses."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educ