{"id": "8th-booster-q1202", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "odd_one_out", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "8th-booster-grammar", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "viyangol-vikuthi-completion", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "அடிக்கோடிட்ட தொடரை நிரப்புக:\n\"வியங்கோள் வினைமுற்று விகுதிகள் ______, ______, இயர், அல் என அமையும்\""}], "options": {"A": "அன், ஆன்", "B": "க, இய", "C": "து, து", "D": "மார், கள்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 42: வியங்கோள் வினைமுற்று விகுதிகள் 'க, இய, இயர், அல்' என்பனவாகும் (எ.கா. வாழ்க, வாழிய, வாழியர்). விடுபட்டவை 'க, இய'."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Fill in the blanks regarding Viyangol Vinaimutru suffixes:\n\"Viyangol Vinaimutru suffixes are ______, ______, iyar, al\":"}], "options": {"A": "an, aan", "B": "ka, iya", "C": "thu, thu", "D": "maar, kal"}, "explanation": "Textbook Page 42: The four optative finite verb suffixes are 'ka, iya, iyar, al'. The missing pair is 'ka, iya'."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 42, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": nu