{"id": "8th-booster-q1229", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "odd_one_out", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "8th-booster-grammar", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "yappu-elements-completion", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "அடிக்கோடிட்ட தொடரை நிரப்புக:\n\"யாப்பின் உறுப்புகள் எழுத்து, அசை, சீர், ______, அடி, தொடை என ஆறு வகைப்படும்\""}], "options": {"A": "தளை", "B": "பாட்டு", "C": "வண்ணம்", "D": "ஓசை"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 177: யாப்பிலக்கணத்தின் ஆறு உறுப்புகள்: எழுத்து, அசை, சீர், தளை, அடி, தொடை. விடுபட்ட சொல் 'தளை'."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Fill in the blank regarding the six elements of Tamil prosody:\n\"The elements of Yappu are Eluthu, Asai, Seer, ______, Adi, Thodai totaling six\":"}], "options": {"A": "Thalai", "B": "Paattu", "C": "Vannam", "D": "Oasai"}, "explanation": "Textbook Page 177: The six limbs of Yappu are Eluthu, Asai, Seer, Thalai, Adi, Thodai. The missing element is 'Thalai'."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 177, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": nu