{"id": "8th-booster-q1230", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "odd_one_out", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "8th-booster-grammar", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "sleidai-alternate-name-completion", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "அடிக்கோடிட்ட தொடரை நிரப்புக:\n\"ஒரு சொல்லோ தொடரோ இருபொருள் தருமாறு பாடப்படுவது ______ அணி எனப்படும்; இதனைச் சிலேடை என்றும் அழைப்பர்\""}], "options": {"A": "வேற்றுமை", "B": "இரட்டுற மொழிதல்", "C": "பிரிது மொழிதல்", "D": "வேற்றுப்பொருள் வைப்பணி"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 183: ஒரு சொல்லோ தொடரோ இரு பொருள்பட அமைவது 'இரட்டுற மொழிதல் அணி' அல்லது 'சிலேடை' எனப்படும். விடுபட்ட சொல் 'இரட்டுற மொழிதல்'."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Fill in the blank in the poetic device definition:\n\"A word or verse composed to impart dual meanings is known as ______ Ani, also designated as Sleidai\":"}], "options": {"A": "Vaetrumai", "B": "Irattura Mozhidhal", "C": "Piridhu Mozhidhal", "D": "Vaetruporul Vaippani"}, "explanation": "Textbook Page 183: A verse with dual meanings is termed 'Irattura Mozhidhal Ani' or Sleidai. The missing term is 'Irattura Mozhidhal'."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Tex