{"id": "8th-booster-q1249", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u8-manitham", "lesson_id": "8th-booster-pyq", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "pyq-marabuthaodar-meanings-match", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "TNPSC தேர்வுகளில் கேட்கப்பட்ட மரபுத்தொடர்களையும் அவற்றின் பொருள்களையும் பொருத்துக:\nபட்டியல் I:\nஅ) ஆகாயத் தாமரை\nஆ) கானல் நீர்\nஇ) கிணற்றுத் தவளை\nஈ) ஆயிரம் காலத்துப் பயிர்\nபட்டியல் II:\n1. இல்லாத ஒன்று (இயலாத செயல்)\n2. இருப்பது போல் தோன்றும் ஆனால் இல்லாதது\n3. உலக அறிவற்ற குறுகிய மனப்பான்மை\n4. நீண்ட காலம் நிலைத்து நிற்பது"}], "options": {"A": "அ-1, ஆ-2, இ-3, ஈ-4", "B": "அ-2, ஆ-1, இ-4, ஈ-3", "C": "அ-1, ஆ-3, இ-2, ஈ-4", "D": "அ-3, ஆ-4, இ-1, ஈ-2"}, "explanation": "TNPSC Group 4 (2014, 2018): ஆகாயத் தாமரை - இல்லாத ஒன்று (1); கானல் நீர் - பொய்த்தோற்றம் (2); கிணற்றுத் தவளை - உலக அறிவற்றவர் (3); ஆயிரம் காலத்துப் பயிர் - நீண்ட காலம் நிலைப்பது (4). நேரடிப் பொருத்தம்: 1, 2, 3, 4."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the traditional Tamil idioms with their meanings from TNPSC exams:\nList I:\na) Aagayath Thaamarai\nb) Kaanal Neer\nc) Kinatrut Thavalai\nd) Aayiram Kaalatthup Payir\nList II:\n1. An absolute impossibility / non-existent entity\n2. An illusion appearing real but absent\n3. Parochial narrowness lacking worldly exposure\n4. An institution intended to endure for centuries"}], "options": {"A": "a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4", "B": "a-2, b-1, c-4, d-3", "C": "a-1, b-3, c-2, d-4", "D": "a-3, b-4, c-1, d-2"}, "explanation": "TNPSC Group 4: All four idioms match directly in serial order: 1, 2, 3, 4."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 114, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["8th-tamil", "booster-pyq", "idioms", "matching", "tnpsc"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "8th-booster-q1250", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-booster-bridging", "lesson_id": "8th-booster-pyq", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "pyq-vina-types-match", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "TNPSC தேர்வுகளில் கேட்கப்பட்ட வினா வகைகளையும் அவற்றின் சான்றுகளையும் பொருத்துக:\nபட்டியல் I:\nஅ) அறிவினா\nஆ) அறியாவினா\nஇ) கொளல்வினா\nஈ) கொடைவினா\nபட்டியல் II:\n1. 'மாணவர்களே பாரத ரத்னா விருது பெற்ற முதல் தமிழக முதல்வர் யார்?' என ஆசிரியர் கேட்டல்\n2. 'கடைக்காரரே பருப்பு உள்ளதா?' எனப் பொருளை வாங்கும் பொருட்டுக் கேட்டல்\n3. 'இக்குறளின் பொருள் யாது?' என மாணவர் ஆசிரியரிடம் கேட்டல்\n4. 'மாணவர்களே உங்களிடம் சீருடை இல்லையோ?' எனக் கொடுக்கும் பொருட்டுக் கேட்டல்"}], "options": {"A": "அ-1, ஆ-2, இ-3, ஈ-4", "B": "அ-1, ஆ-3, இ-2, ஈ-4", "C": "அ-3, ஆ-1, இ-2, ஈ-4", "D": "அ-2, ஆ-3, இ-1, ஈ-4"}, "explanation": "TNPSC Group 4 (2015, 2017, 2019): ஆசிரியர் மாணவரிடம் விடை தெரிந்து கேட்டல் - அறிவினா (1); மாணவர் அறியாமல் கேட்டல் - அறியாவினா (3); வாங்குவதற்காகக் கேட்டல் - கொளல்வினா (2); தருவதற்காகக் கேட்டல் - கொடைவினா (4). சரியான வரிசை: 1, 3, 2, 4."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the interrogative types with their textbook examples from TNPSC exams:\nList I:\na) Arivina (Question by one who knows)\nb) Ariyaavina (Question by one who doesn't know)\nc) Kolalvina (Question to purchase/obtain)\nd) Kodaivina (Question to donate/give)\nList II:\n1. Teacher asking students who was the first TN Chief Minister to get Bharat Ratna\n2. Customer asking shopkeeper if lentils are available\n3. Student asking teacher the meaning of a kural couplet\n4. Teacher asking pupils if they lack uniforms so as to provide them"}], "options": {"A": "a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4", "B": "a-1, b-3, c-2, d-4", "C": "a-3, b-1, c-2, d-4", "D": "a-2, b-3, c-1, d-4"}, "explanation": "TNPSC Group 4: Teacher testing student - Arivina (1); Student inquiring - Ariyaavina (3); Buying - Kolal (2); Gifting - Kodai (4). Sequence: 1, 3, 2, 4."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 42, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["8th-tamil", "booster-pyq", "vina-types", "matching", "tnpsc"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "8th-booster-q1251", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-booster-bridging", "lesson_id": "8th-booster-pyq", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "pyq-vidai-types-match", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "TNPSC தேர்வுகளில் கேட்கப்பட்ட விடை வகைகளையும் அவற்றின் சான்றுகளையும் பொருத்துக:\nபட்டியல் I:\nஅ) சுட்டுவிடை\nஆ) மறைவிடை\nஇ) ஏவல்விடை\nஈ) உற்றது உரைத்தல் விடை\nபட்டியல் II:\n1. 'நீ விளையாடவில்லையா?' என்ற கேள்விக்கு 'கால் வலிக்கிறது' எனத் தனக்கு நேர்ந்ததைக் கூறல்\n2. 'கடைத்தெரு எங்குள்ளது?' என்ற வினாவிற்கு 'வலப்பக்கத்தில் உள்ளது' எனக் சுட்டிக்காட்டல்\n3. 'இச்செயலைச் செய்வாயா?' என்றதற்கு 'செய்யேன்' என மறுத்துக் கூறல்\n4. 'இப்பாடத்தைப் படி' என்றதற்கு 'நீயே படி' என ஏவிக் கூறல்"}], "options": {"A": "அ-1, ஆ-2, இ-3, ஈ-4", "B": "அ-2, ஆ-1, இ-4, ஈ-3", "C": "அ-2, ஆ-3, இ-4, ஈ-1", "D": "அ-3, ஆ-4, இ-1, ஈ-2"}, "explanation": "TNPSC Group 4 (2016, 2018): சுட்டிக்காட்டுதல் - சுட்டுவிடை (2); மறுத்துக் கூறல் - மறைவிடை (3); ஏவிக் கூறல் - ஏவல்விடை (4); தனக்கு உற்ற துன்பத்தைக் கூறல் - உற்றது உரைத்தல் விடை (1). சரியான வரிசை: 2, 3, 4, 1."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the response classifications with their classical examples from TNPSC exams:\nList I:\na) Suttu Vidai (Indicative answer)\nb) Marai Vidai (Refusal answer)\nc) Eaval Vidai (Imperative rejoinder)\nd) Utrathu Uraitthal Vidai (Answering with personal affliction)\nList II:\n1. Replying 'My leg aches' to 'Will you not play?'\n2. Pointing 'It is on the right side' to 'Where is the market street?'\n3. Refusing 'I will not do it!' to 'Will you do this task?'\n4. Retorting 'You read it yourself!' to 'Read this lesson'"}], "options": {"A": "a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4", "B": "a-2, b-1, c-4, d-3", "C": "a-2, b-3, c-4, d-1", "D": "a-3, b-4, c-1, d-2"}, "explanation": "TNPSC Group 4: Pointing direction - Suttu (2); Negative refusal - Marai (3); Retorting with counter-command - Eaval (4); Stating present affliction - Utrathu Uraitthal (1). Sequence: 2, 3, 4, 1."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 42, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["8th-tamil", "booster-pyq", "vidai-types", "matching", "tnpsc"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "8th-booster-q1252", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u4-kalai", "lesson_id": "8th-booster-pyq", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "pyq-vaetrumai-urubu-pirithal", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "TNPSC முந்தைய ஆண்டு வினா: 'வீட்டுக்குச் சென்றான்' - இத்தொடரில் இடம்பெற்றுள்ள வேற்றுமை உருபும் அதன் வேற்றுமை வகையும் யாது?"}], "options": {"A": "இரண்டாம் வேற்றுமை (ஐ உருபு)", "B": "மூன்றாம் வேற்றுமை (ஆல் உருபு)", "C": "ஐந்தாம் வேற்றுமை (இல் உருபு)", "D": "நான்காம் வேற்றுமை ('கு' உருபு - அடைதல் பொருள்)"}, "explanation": "TNPSC Group 4 (2014, 2016): வீடு + கு = வீட்டுக்கு. இதில் 'கு' என்னும் நான்காம் வேற்றுமை உருபு வெளிப்பட்டு வந்து 'சென்றான்' என்ற வினையோடு முடிந்து அடைதல் பொருளைத் தருவதால் நான்காம் வேற்றுமை ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "TNPSC PYQ: Identify the case marker and case classification in 'Veettukkuch sendraan':"}], "options": {"A": "Second Case (Ai suffix)", "B": "Third Case (Aal suffix)", "C": "Fifth Case (Il suffix)", "D": "Fourth Case ('Ku' suffix - Destination/Reaching meaning)"}, "explanation": "TNPSC Group 4: 'Ku' is the fourth case dative suffix denoting destination ('Adaithal Porul'). Correct answer is D."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 86, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["8th-tamil", "booster-pyq", "vaetrumai", "grammar", "tnpsc"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "8th-booster-q1253", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "8th-booster-pyq", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "pyq-ilakkana-kurippu-semmozhi", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "TNPSC முந்தைய ஆண்டு வினா: 'செந்தமிழ்' - இச்சொல்லின் சரியான இலக்கணக் குறிப்பினைத் தேர்க:"}], "options": {"A": "பண்புத்தொகை (செம்மை + தமிழ் = செந்தமிழ்; மை விகுதியும் ஆகிய உருபும் மறைந்த பண்புத்தொகை)", "B": "வினைத்தொகை", "C": "உவமைத்தொகை", "D": "உம்மைத்தொகை"}, "explanation": "TNPSC Group 4 & Group 2 பலமுறை கேட்கப்பட்ட வினா: செம்மை + தமிழ் = செந்தமிழ். மை விகுதி கெட்டு, 'ஆகிய' என்னும் பண்பு உருபு மறைந்து நின்றதால் இது 'பண்புத்தொகை' ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "TNPSC PYQ: Identify the correct grammatical classification (Ilakkana Kurippu) for 'Senthamizh':"}], "options": {"A": "Panbuthogai ('Semmai + Thamizh = Senthamizh'; attributive compound with elision of 'mai' and 'aagiya')", "B": "Vinaithogai", "C": "Uvamaithogai", "D": "Ummaithogai"}, "explanation": "TNPSC perennial question: Senthamizh is an attributive compound (Panbuthogai) formed by dropping the 'mai' suffix of 'semmai'."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 110, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["8th-tamil", "booster-pyq", "panbuthogai", "grammar", "tnpsc"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "8th-booster-q1254", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u3-kalvi", "lesson_id": "8th-booster-pyq", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "pyq-echam-type-identification", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "TNPSC முந்தைய ஆண்டு வினா: 'வந்து சேர்ந்தான்' - இத்தொடரில் உள்ள 'வந்து' என்னும் சொல்லின் இலக்கணக் குறிப்பு யாது?"}], "options": {"A": "பெயரெச்சம்", "B": "தெரிநிலை வினையெச்சம் (செயலையும் இறந்தகாலத்தையும் காட்டிச் 'சேர்ந்தான்' என்னும் வினைமுற்றைக் கொண்டு முடிந்தது)", "C": "முற்றெச்சம்", "D": "குறிப்பு வினையெச்சம்"}, "explanation": "TNPSC Group 4 (2015, 2018): 'வந்து' என்பது வருகை புரிந்த செயலை வெளிப்படையாகவும் காலத்தையும் காட்டி 'சேர்ந்தான்' என்ற வினைமுற்றைக் கொண்டு முடிவதால் 'தெரிநிலை வினையெச்சம்' ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "TNPSC PYQ: Identify the grammatical classification of the word 'Vandhu' in 'Vandhu searndhaan':"}], "options": {"A": "Relative Participle (Peyarecham)", "B": "Direct Adverbial Participle (Terinilai Vinaiyecham: denotes action and past tense, terminating on a finite verb)", "C": "Mutrecham", "D": "Kurippu Vinaiyecham"}, "explanation": "TNPSC Group 4: 'Vandhu' overtly signals past action and modifies the finite verb 'searndhaan', qualifying as Terinilai Vinaiyecham."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 62, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["8th-tamil", "booster-pyq", "vinaiyecham", "grammar", "tnpsc"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "8th-booster-q1255", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u6-naadu", "lesson_id": "8th-booster-pyq", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "pyq-sandhi-punarchi-rule", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "TNPSC முந்தைய ஆண்டு வினா: 'மணியடி' - இச்சொல்லின் சரியான புணர்ச்சி விதிகளின் வரிசை எது?\nமணி + அடி = மணியடி"}], "options": {"A": "உடல்மேல் உயிர்வந்து ஒன்றுவது இயல்பே மட்டும்", "B": "தனிக்குறில் முன் ஒற்று உயிர்வரின் இரட்டும்", "C": "'இ ஈ ஐ வழி யவ்வும்' என்ற விதிப்படி யகர உடம்படுமெய் தோன்றி, பின்னர் 'உடல்மேல் உயிர்வந்து ஒன்றுவது இயல்பே' என்னும் விதிப்படி புணர்ந்தது", "D": "திசைப்பெயர் புணர்ச்சி விதி"}, "explanation": "TNPSC Group 2 & Group 4: மணி (இகார ஈறு) + அடி. 1. இ ஈ ஐ வழி யவ்வும் -> மணி + ய் + அடி; 2. உடல்மேல் உயிர்வந்து ஒன்றுவது இயல்பே (ய் + அ = ய) -> மணியடி. சரியான வரிசை C."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "TNPSC PYQ: Identify the exact sequence of Sandhi rules for 'Maniyadi' (Mani + Adi = Maniyadi):"}], "options": {"A": "Only 'Udalmel uyirvandhu ondruvathu iyalbe'", "B": "Doubling of solitary consonant before a vowel", "C": "Glide 'y' emerges via 'I, Ee, Ai vazhi yavvum', followed by consonant-vowel merger via 'Udalmel uyirvandhu ondruvathu iyalbe'", "D": "Directional sandhi rule"}, "explanation": "TNPSC Group 2 & 4: Mani ends in 'i'. First rule inserts glide 'y' ('I Ee Ai vazhi yavvum'); second merges 'y + a = ya'. Option C is accurate."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 133, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["8th-tamil", "booster-pyq", "punarchi", "grammar", "tnpsc"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "8th-booster-q1256", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "odd_one_out", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-booster-bridging", "lesson_id": "8th-booster-pyq", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "pyq-bharathidasan-books-odd-one-out", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "TNPSC முந்தைய ஆண்டு வினா: பாவேந்தர் பாரதிதாசன் இயற்றாத நூல் எது?"}], "options": {"A": "பாண்டியன் பரிசு", "B": "அழகின் சிரிப்பு", "C": "இருண்ட வீடு", "D": "குயில் பாட்டு (சுப்பிரமணிய பாரதியார் இயற்றியது; பாரதிதாசன் இயற்றியதன்று)"}, "explanation": "TNPSC Group 4 (2014, 2016, 2018): பாண்டியன் பரிசு, அழகின் சிரிப்பு, இருண்ட வீடு, குடும்ப விளக்கு முதலியவை பாரதிதாசன் இயற்றியவை. 'குயில் பாட்டு' மகாகவி பாரதியார் இயற்றிய முப்பெரும் காவியங்களுள் ஒன்றாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "TNPSC PYQ: Which of the following works was NOT authored by Paavendhar Bharathidasan?"}], "options": {"A": "Pandiyan Parisu", "B": "Azhagin Sirippu", "C": "Irunda Veedu", "D": "Kuyil Paattu (Authored by Subramania Bharati, not Bharathidasan)"}, "explanation": "TNPSC Group 4: Pandiyan Parisu, Azhagin Sirippu, and Irunda Veedu were penned by Bharathidasan. 'Kuyil Paattu' was composed by Subramania Bharati."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samache