{"id": "8th-booster-q1277", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-booster-bridging", "lesson_id": "8th-booster-pyq", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "pyq-thirumurai-authors-match", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பன்னிரு திருமுறைகளின் ஆசிரியர்களைப் பொருத்துக (TNPSC அண்மைக்கால வினா):\nபட்டியல் I:\nஅ) முதல் மூன்று திருமுறைகள் (1, 2, 3)\nஆ) அடுத்த மூன்று திருமுறைகள் (4, 5, 6)\nஇ) ஏழாம் திருமுறை\nஈ) எட்டாம் திருமுறை (திருவாசகம், திருக்கோவையார்)\nபட்டியல் II:\n1. திருஞானசம்பந்தர்\n2. திருநாவுக்கரசர் (அப்பர்)\n3. சுந்தரர் (நம்பியாரூரர்)\n4. மாணிக்கவாசகர்"}], "options": {"A": "அ-1, ஆ-2, இ-3, ஈ-4", "B": "அ-2, ஆ-1, இ-4, ஈ-3", "C": "அ-1, ஆ-3, இ-2, ஈ-4", "D": "அ-3, ஆ-4, இ-1, ஈ-2"}, "explanation": "TNPSC Group 4 (2022, 2024) & பாடநூல் பக். 94: திருமுறைகள் வரிசை: 1, 2, 3 - திருஞானசம்பந்தர் (1); 4, 5, 6 - திருநாவுக்கரசர் (2); 7 - சுந்தரர் (3); 8 - மாணிக்கவாசகர் (4). நேரடிப் பொருத்தம்: 1, 2, 3, 4."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the authors of the Saiva Thirumurai canon from recent TNPSC exams:\nList I:\na) First Three Thirumurais (1, 2, 3)\nb) Next Three Thirumurais (4, 5, 6)\nc) Seventh Thirumurai\nd) Eighth Thirumurai (Thiruvasagam, Thirukkovaiyar)\nList II:\n1. Thirugnanasambandar\n2. Thirunavukkarasar (Appar)\n3. Sundarar (Nambiyaaroorar)\n4. Manickavasagar"}], "options": {"A": "a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4", "B": "a-2, b-1, c-4, d-3", "C": "a-1, b-3, c-2, d-4", "D": "a-3, b-4, c-1, d-2"}, "explanation": "TNPSC Group 4 & Textbook Page 94: Canon mapping: 1-3 Sambandar; 4-6 Appar; 7 Sundarar; 8 Manickavasagar. Direct sequence: 1, 2, 3, 4."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 94, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["8th-tamil", "booster-pyq", "thirumurai", "saivism", "matching", "tnpsc"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "8th-booster-q1278", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-booster-bridging", "lesson_id": "8th-booster-pyq", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "pyq-jain-epics-metrics-match", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "சமணக் காப்பியங்களையும் அவற்றின் முக்கியக் குறிப்புகளையும் பொருத்துக:\nபட்டியல் I:\nஅ) நீலகேசி\nஆ) சூளாமணி\nஇ) சீவக சிந்தாமணி\nஈ) யசோதர காவியம்\nபட்டியல் II:\n1. ஐம்பெருங் காப்பியங்களுள் திருத்தக்கதேவரால் பாடப்பட்ட சமணக் காப்பியம்\n2. ஐஞ்சிறு காப்பியங்களுள் தருமவுரைச் சருக்கம் கொண்ட தர்க்க நூல்\n3. ஐஞ்சிறு காப்பியங்களுள் தோலாமொழித்தேவர் இயற்றிய காப்பியம்\n4. ஐஞ்சிறு காப்பியங்களுள் வெண்ணாவலூருடையார் இயற்றிய சிறுநூல்"}], "options": {"A": "அ-1, ஆ-2, இ-3, ஈ-4", "B": "அ-2, ஆ-3, இ-1, ஈ-4", "C": "அ-3, ஆ-1, இ-4, ஈ-2", "D": "அ-2, ஆ-1, இ-4, ஈ-3"}, "explanation": "TNPSC Group 2 & Group 4 & பாடநூல் பக். 156: நீலகேசி - தருமவுரைச் சருக்கம் கொண்ட ஐஞ்சிறு காப்பியம் (2); சூளாமணி - தோலாமொழித்தேவர் (3); சீவக சிந்தாமணி - திருத்தக்கதேவர் பெருங்காப்பியம் (1); யசோதர காவியம் - சிறுநூல் (4). சரியான வரிசை: 2, 3, 1, 4."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the Jain epics with their salient literary descriptions:\nList I:\na) Neelakesi\nb) Choolamani\nc) Seevaga Chinthamani\nd) Yasodhara Kaaviyam\nList II:\n1. Major epic composed by Thirutthakkadhevar expounding Jain ideals\n2. Minor epic with Dharamavurai Sarukkam serving as philosophical polemic\n3. Minor epic composed by Tholamozhidhevar\n4. Minor epic attributed to Vennaavalurudaiyar"}], "options": {"A": "a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4", "B": "a-2, b-3, c-1, d-4", "C": "a-3, b-1, c-4, d-2", "D": "a-2, b-1, c-4, d-3"}, "explanation": "Neelakesi - Polemic minor epic (2); Choolamani - Tholamozhidhevar (3); Seevaga Chinthamani - Thirutthakkadhevar (1); Yasodhara Kaaviyam (4). Sequence: 2, 3, 1, 4."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 156, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["8th-tamil", "booster-pyq", "jain-epics", "matching", "tnpsc"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "8th-booster-q1279", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u5-vanigam", "lesson_id": "8th-booster-pyq", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "pyq-thogai-grammar-examples-match", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தொகைநிலைத் தொடர்களை அவற்றிற்குரிய இலக்கணச் சான்றுகளோடு பொருத்துக (TNPSC 2024 வினா):\nபட்டியல் I:\nஅ) கரும்பு தின்றான்\nஆ) கொல்களிறு\nஇ) மலர்க்கை\nஈ) வட்டப்பலகை\nபட்டியல் II:\n1. உவமைத்தொகை\n2. பண்புத்தொகை\n3. இரண்டாம் வேற்றுமைத்தொகை\n4. வினைத்தொகை"}], "options": {"A": "அ-1, ஆ-2, இ-3, ஈ-4", "B": "அ-3, ஆ-1, இ-4, ஈ-2", "C": "அ-3, ஆ-4, இ-1, ஈ-2", "D": "அ-2, ஆ-3, இ-1, ஈ-4"}, "explanation": "TNPSC Group 4 (2024): கரும்பு தின்றான் - 2-ஆம் வேற்றுமைத்தொகை (3); கொல்களிறு - வினைத்தொகை (4); மலர்க்கை - உவமைத்தொகை (1); வட்டப்பலகை - பண்புத்தொகை (2). சரியான வரிசை: 3, 4, 1, 2."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the compound expressions with their exact classifications (TNPSC 2024):\nList I:\na) Karumbu thindraan\nb) Kolkaliru\nc) Malarkkai\nd) Vattappalagai\nList II:\n1. Uvamaithogai\n2. Panbuthogai\n3. Second Case Accusative Compound\n4. Vinaithogai"}], "options": {"A": "a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4", "B": "a-3, b-1, c-4, d-2", "C": "a-3, b-4, c-1, d-2", "D": "a-2, b-3, c-1, d-4"}, "explanation": "TNPSC Group 4 (2024): Karumbu thindraan - 2nd case (3); Kolkaliru - Vinaithogai (4); Malarkkai - Uvamaithogai (1); Vattappalagai - Panbuthogai (2). Sequence: 3, 4, 1, 2."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 110, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["8th-tamil", "booster-pyq", "thogai-grammar", "matching", "tnpsc"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "8th-booster-q1280", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u6-naadu", "lesson_id": "8th-booster-pyq", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "pyq-kuttiyalugaram-punarchi-rule", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "TNPSC அண்மைக்கால வினா: 'நாடியாது' - இச்சொல்லின் சரியான புணர்ச்சி விதியைத் தேர்க:\nநாடு + யாது = நாடியாது"}], "options": {"A": "உடல்மேல் உயிர்வந்து ஒன்றுவது இயல்பே", "B": "தனிக்குறில் முன் ஒற்று உயிர்வரின் இரட்டும்", "C": "மவ்வீறு ஒற்று அழிந்து உயிரீறு ஒப்பவும்", "D": "'யாவரின் இய்யாம்' என்னும் விதிப்படி நிலைமொழி ஈற்றுக் குற்றியலுகரம் இகரமாகத் திரிந்தது (குற்றியலிகரம்)"}, "explanation": "TNPSC Group 4 (2022, 2024) & பாடநூல் பக். 134: நிலைமொழி ஈற்றில் குற்றியலுகரம் (நாடு - டு = ட் + உ) நின்று, வருமொழி முதலில் யகர உயிர்மெய் (யாது) வந்தால், நிலைமொழி உகரம் இகரமாகத் திரியும் (நாடியாது). நன்னூல் விதி: 'யாவரின் இய்யாம்'."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "TNPSC Recent PYQ: Identify the correct Sandhi rule for 'Naadiyaadhu' (Naadu + Yaadhu = Naadiyaadhu):"}], "options": {"A": "Udalmel uyirvandhu ondruvathu iyalbe", "B": "Doubling of solitary consonant before a vowel", "C": "Mavveeru otru azhindhu uyireeru oppavum", "D": "By rule 'Yaavarin iyyaam', terminal short 'u' transforms into short 'i' (Kuttiyaligaram) before incoming 'y'"}, "explanation": "Textbook Page 134 & TNPSC 2022/2024: Before initial 'y', Kuttiyalugaram mutates into Kuttiyaligaram via the rule 'Yaavarin iyyaam'. Option D is correct."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 134, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["8th-tamil", "booster-pyq", "kuttiyaligaram", "grammar", "tnpsc"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "8th-booster-q1281", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-booster-bridging", "lesson_id": "8th-booster-pyq", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "pyq-peyaracham-thodar-correction", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "TNPSC முந்தைய ஆண்டு வினா: பின்வரும் தொடர்களுள் 'பெயரெச்சத் தொடரை'ச் சரியாகத் தேர்க:"}], "options": {"A": "எழுதிய கடிதம்", "B": "பாடி மகிழ்ந்தான்", "C": "கண்ணகி பாடினாள்", "D": "நண்பா கேள்"}, "explanation": "TNPSC Group 4 & பாடநூல் பக். 113: 'எழுதிய' என்பது முடிவு பெறாத பெயரெச்சம்; அது 'கடிதம்' என்ற பெயர்ச்சொல்லைக் கொண்டு முடிந்ததால் 'பெயரெச்சத் தொடர்' ஆகும் (பாடி மகிழ்ந்தான் - வினையெச்சத் தொடர்; கண்ணகி பாடினாள் - எழுவாய்த் தொடர்; நண்பா கேள் - விளித்தொடர்)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "TNPSC PYQ: Identify the correct 'Relative Participle Phrase' (Peyarecha Thodar):"}], "options": {"A": "Ezhudhiya kadidham", "B": "Paadi magizhndhaan", "C": "Kannagi paadinaal", "D": "Nanbaa keal"}, "explanation": "Textbook Page 113 & TNPSC: 'Ezhudhiya' is a relative participle modifying noun 'kadidham', forming Peyarecha Thodar."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 113, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["8th-tamil", "booster-pyq", "peyarecham", "thoganilai", "grammar", "tnpsc"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "8th-booster-q1282", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u2-iyarkai", "lesson_id": "8th-booster-pyq", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "pyq-vinaithogai-identification", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "TNPSC அண்மைக்கால வினா: 'சுடுசோறு' - இச்சொல்லின் சரியான இலக்கணக் குறிப்பினைத் தேர்க:"}], "options": {"A": "பண்புத்தொகை", "B": "வினைத்தொகை (சுட்ட சோறு, சுடுகின்ற சோறு, சுடும் சோறு என முக்காலத்திற்கும் விரியும்)", "C": "உவமைத்தொகை", "D": "உம்மைத்தொகை"}, "explanation": "TNPSC Group 4 (2022) & பாடநூல் பக். 111: 'சுடு' என்ற வினைப்பகுதி 'சோறு' என்ற பெயர்ச்சொல்லோடு இணைந்து முக்கால இடைநிலையும் தொக்கு நின்றதால் 'வினைத்தொகை' ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "TNPSC Recent PYQ: Identify the exact grammatical classification for 'Sudusoru':"}], "options": {"A": "Panbuthogai", "B": "Vinaithogai (Spanning past, present, future: 'sutta soru', 'sudugindra soru', 'sudum soru')", "C": "Uvamaithogai", "D": "Ummaithogai"}, "explanation": "TNPSC Group 4 (2022): 'Sudusoru' is an archetype of Vinaithogai, spanning all three tenses with elision of tense infixes."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 111, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["8th-tamil", "booster-pyq", "vinaithogai", "grammar", "tnpsc"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "8th-booster-q1283", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u7-aram", "lesson_id": "8th-booster-pyq", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "pyq-vallinam-migu-miga-identification", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "TNPSC முந்தைய ஆண்டு வினா: பின்வருவனவற்றுள் வல்லினம் மிகக் கூடாத பிழையான தொடர் எது?"}], "options": {"A": "அந்தப் புத்தகம் (சரி)", "B": "கதவைத் திறந்தான் (சரி)", "C": "குடித் தண்ணீர் (தவறு - வினைத்தொகையில் வல்லினம் மிகக் கூடாது; 'குடிதண்ணீர்' என்பதே சரி)", "D": "சுடுசோறு (சரி)"}, "explanation": "TNPSC Group 4 & பாடநூல் பக். 156: வினைத்தொகையில் வல்லினம் மிகக் கூடாது என்பது விதி. 'குடித் தண்ணீர்' எனத் தகர ஒற்று இட்டு எழுதியுள்ளது பிழையானது; 'குடிதண்ணீர்' என்பதே சரியானது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "TNPSC PYQ: In which of the following phrases is gemination of plosives WRONGLY/ERRONEOUSLY applied?"}], "options": {"A": "Andhap putthagam (Correct gemination)", "B": "Kadhavait thirandhaan (Correct gemination)", "C": "Kudith thanneer (Erroneous: plosives cannot geminate in Vinaithogai; 'Kudithanneer' is correct)", "D": "Sudusoru (Correct non-gemination)"}, "explanation": "Textbook Page 156 & TNPSC: Gemination is strictly prohibited in Vinaithogai compounds. 'Kudith thanneer' with geminated 'th' is grammatically incorrect. Correct form is 'Kudithanneer'."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negat