{"id": "8th-booster-q1286", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "odd_one_out", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-booster-bridging", "lesson_id": "8th-booster-pyq", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "pyq-agananooru-ship-quote-completion", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "அடிக்கோடிட்ட தொடரை நிரப்புக (TNPSC PYQ):\n\"உலகு கிளர்ந்தன்ன உருகெழு ______ (அகநானூறு)\""}], "options": {"A": "நாவாய்", "B": "வங்கம்", "C": "தோணி", "D": "கப்பல்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 73 & TNPSC பலமுறை வினா: அகநானூற்றுப் பாடல் வரி: 'உலகு கிளர்ந்தன்ன உருகெழு வங்கம்'. விடுபட்ட சொல் 'வங்கம்' (பெரிய கப்பல்)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Complete the classical Sangam maritime quotation from Aganaanooru (TNPSC PYQ):\n\"Ulagu kilarndhanna urukezhu ______ (Aganaanooru)\":"}], "options": {"A": "Naavaai", "B": "Vangam", "C": "Thoni", "D": "Kappal"}, "explanation": "Textbook Page 73 & TNPSC recurring verse: 'Ulagu kilarndhanna urukezhu vangam'. The missing word is 'Vangam'."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 73, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": nu