{"id": "8th-booster-q1288", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "direct", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u8-manitham", "lesson_id": "8th-booster-pyq", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "pyq-ambedkar-bharat-ratna-year-direct", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "TNPSC முந்தைய ஆண்டு வினா: டாக்டர் பி.ஆர். அம்பேத்கருக்கு இந்திய அரசு 'பாரத ரத்னா' விருதை வழங்கிய ஆண்டு எது?"}], "options": {"A": "1980", "B": "1985", "C": "1988", "D": "1990"}, "explanation": "TNPSC Group 4 (2022, 2024) & பாடநூல் பக். 163: அம்பேத்கருக்கு 1990-ஆம் ஆண்டு நாட்டின் உயரிய 'பாரத ரத்னா' விருது வழங்கப்பட்டது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "TNPSC PYQ: In which year did the Government of India confer the 'Bharat Ratna' upon Dr. B.R. Ambedkar?"}], "options": {"A": "1980", "B": "1985", "C": "1988", "D": "1990"}, "explanation": "TNPSC Group 4 (2022, 2024) & Textbook Page 163: Dr. B.R. Ambedkar was posthumously honored with the Bharat Ratna in 1990."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 163, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes