{"id": "8th-booster-q1332", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "8th-booster-finale", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "musical-instruments-fourfold-match", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "இசைக்கருவிகளின் நான்கு பெரும் பிரிவுகளையும் அவற்றுக்குரிய கருவிகளையும் பொருத்துக:\nபட்டியல் I:\nஅ) தோற்கருவி\nஆ) நரம்புக்கருவி\nஇ) காற்றுக்கருவி\nஈ) கஞ்சக்கருவி\nபட்டியல் II:\n1. சாலரா\n2. புல்லாங்குழல்\n3. வீணை\n4. மத்தளம்"}], "options": {"A": "அ-1, ஆ-2, இ-3, ஈ-4", "B": "அ-3, ஆ-4, இ-2, ஈ-1", "C": "அ-4, ஆ-2, இ-3, ஈ-1", "D": "அ-4, ஆ-3, இ-2, ஈ-1"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 79-80: தோற்கருவி - மத்தளம் (4); நரம்புக்கருவி - வீணை (3); காற்றுக்கருவி - புல்லாங்குழல் (2); கஞ்சக்கருவி - சாலரா (1). சரியான வரிசை: 4, 3, 2, 1."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the fourfold instrumental categories with their representative instruments:\nList I:\na) Thorkaruvi (Membranophone)\nb) Narambukkaruvi (Chordophone)\nc) Kaattrukkaruvi (Aerophone)\nd) Kanjakkaruvi (Idiophone)\nList II:\n1. Saalara (Cymbals)\n2. Pullaanguzhal (Flute)\n3. Veenai (Lute)\n4. Mattalam (Drum)"}], "options": {"A": "a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4", "B": "a-3, b-4, c-2, d-1", "C": "a-4, b-2, c-3, d-1", "D": "a-4, b-3, c-2, d-1"}, "explanation": "Textbook Pages 79-80: Drum - Thorkaruvi (4); Veenai - Narambukkaruvi (3); Flute - Wind (2); Cymbals - Metallic idiophone (1). Sequence: 4, 3, 2, 1."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 79, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["8th-tamil", "booster-finale", "instruments", "matching", "tnpsc"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "8th-booster-q1333", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "8th-booster-finale", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "paai-mats-types-match", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தமிழர் பயன்படுத்திய பாய்களையும் அவற்றின் பயன்பாடுகளையும் பொருத்துக:\nபட்டியல் I:\nஅ) தடுக்குப் பாய்\nஆ) பந்திப் பாய்\nஇ) திண்ணைப் பாய்\nஈ) பட்டுப் பாய்\nபட்டியல் II:\n1. குழந்தைகளைப் படுக்க வைப்பது\n2. உட்கார்ந்து உணவருந்த உதவுவது\n3. உட்காரவும் படுக்கவும் உதவுவது\n4. திருமணத்திற்குப் பயன்படுவது"}], "options": {"A": "அ-1, ஆ-2, இ-3, ஈ-4", "B": "அ-2, ஆ-1, இ-4, ஈ-3", "C": "அ-1, ஆ-3, இ-2, ஈ-4", "D": "அ-3, ஆ-4, இ-1, ஈ-2"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 102: தடுக்குப் பாய் - குழந்தைகள் (1); பந்திப் பாய் - உணவு (2); திண்ணைப் பாய் - அமர/படுக்க (3); பட்டுப் பாய் - திருமணம் (4). நேரடிப் பொருத்தம்: 1, 2, 3, 4."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the varieties of traditional woven reed mats with their uses:\nList I:\na) Thadukku Paai\nb) Pandhi Paai\nc) Thinnai Paai\nd) Pattu Paai\nList II:\n1. Bedding for infants\n2. Dining seated in rows\n3. Sitting and lounging on verandas\n4. Wedding ceremonial gift and bridal use"}], "options": {"A": "a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4", "B": "a-2, b-1, c-4, d-3", "C": "a-1, b-3, c-2, d-4", "D": "a-3, b-4, c-1, d-2"}, "explanation": "Textbook Page 102: All four traditional mat functions correspond directly in sequential order: 1, 2, 3, 4."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 102, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["8th-tamil", "booster-finale", "paai-types", "matching", "tnpsc"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "8th-booster-q1334", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "8th-booster-finale", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "poetic-beauties-types-match", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தொடை நயங்களையும் அவற்றின் இலக்கண விதிகளையும் பொருத்துக:\nபட்டியல் I:\nஅ) மோனை\nஆ) எதுகை\nஇ) இயைபு\nஈ) முரண்\nபட்டியல் II:\n1. இரண்டாம் எழுத்து ஒன்றி வரத் தொடுப்பது\n2. முதலெழுத்து ஒன்றி வரத் தொடுப்பது\n3. முரண்பட்ட பொருள்தரும் சொற்கள் அமையத் தொடுப்பது\n4. இறுதி எழுத்தோ சீரோ ஒன்றி வரத் தொடுப்பது"}], "options": {"A": "அ-1, ஆ-2, இ-3, ஈ-4", "B": "அ-2, ஆ-1, இ-4, ஈ-3", "C": "அ-2, ஆ-4, இ-1, ஈ-3", "D": "அ-3, ஆ-1, இ-4, ஈ-2"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 178: மோனை - முதல் எழுத்து (2); எதுகை - இரண்டாம் எழுத்து (1); இயைபு - இறுதி எழுத்து (4); முரண் - முரண்பட்ட பொருள் (3). சரியான வரிசை: 2, 1, 4, 3."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the poetic devices (Thodai Nayam) with their rules:\nList I:\na) Monai\nb) Edhugai\nc) Iyaibu\nd) Muran\nList II:\n1. Consonance of the second letter\n2. Consonance of the initial letter\n3. Antithetical juxtaposition of contrasting concepts\n4. Consonance of terminal letters/cadences"}], "options": {"A": "a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4", "B": "a-2, b-1, c-4, d-3", "C": "a-2, b-4, c-1, d-3", "D": "a-3, b-1, c-4, d-2"}, "explanation": "Textbook Page 178: Monai - 1st letter (2); Edhugai - 2nd letter (1); Iyaibu - End rhyme (4); Muran - Antithesis (3). Sequence: 2, 1, 4, 3."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answ